      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ORARA JAKO (4) has a terrific record this track and trip with two wins and one placing from three starts. Scored by 1.5 lengths last time (19.89) in a Grade 5 over 350m at this track. Appeals as a leading chance in this. HARLEM RIPPLE (1) is having his first start around this circuit. Missed the frame last time when 4th and beaten 6 lengths (20.37) at Capalaba. A big run wouldn't surprise. ZIPPING BJORN (7) is super consistent overall, having placed 21 of 33 career runs. Finished in the minors latest when third (20.23) at this track and may be close to breaking through. Has performed well from this box with a win and two minor placings to his name from five starts. Expected to be in the finish again. STAINED ACES (2) can fill a top-three spot.",
